## Move scenario Results onto the workbench
================================================================================

Context: Results lived in a separate sidebar item with a scenario picker, so
the diff was detached from the run that produced it. Results belong to one
scenario and should be a workbench tab.

Changes:

1. src/front/config/menu_config.json
   Drop the Results sidebar item; keep Runs under Scenarios.
2. src/front/templates/partials/simulation/_sim_workbench.html
   Add a Results tab that includes the diff pane for the open scenario.
3. src/front/templates/partials/simulation/_sim_results.html
   Remove the scenario picker; empty state is "no results for this scenario".
4. src/front/static/simulation/js/simulation.js
   Open Results as a workbench tab instead of switching sidebar section.
5. src/front/static/global/js/task-tracker.js
   Completed simulation tasks open workbench with tab=results.

