## Keep list and editor on one Scenarios URL
================================================================================

Context: Refreshing /simulation/?section=workbench opened a blank scenario
because the open id was not in the URL. List and editor should share
?section=scenarios, with simulation=<id> selecting the editor.

Changes:

1. src/front/templates/simulation.html
   Nest list and editor in the Scenarios section; drop workbench-section.
2. src/front/static/simulation/js/simulation.js
   Sync simulation/tab query params, restore the last id on legacy workbench URLs.
3. src/front/static/simulation/js/simulation-workbench.js
   Back-to-list control; write the saved id into the URL.
4. src/front/static/global/js/task-tracker.js
   Open completed runs at section=scenarios&simulation=.
5. src/front/static/query/js/query-entity-details.js
   Simulate from here uses the Scenarios section.

